  "notes": [
    {
      "zh": "错误码来自 contracts/cobuild-otx-lock/src/error.rs（Error::code）：1–10 ckb-std SysError，20 InvalidArgs，30 MalformedCobuild，31 InvalidOtxLayout，32 InvalidMessageTarget，33 DuplicateSighashAll，34 MissingLockGroupCoverage，35 MissingLockSeal，36 DuplicateLockSeal，38 DuplicateMatchingAction，39 InvalidLockGroupWitness，40 LockSemanticFailure，41 ActionNotFound，50 VerifyFailure，60 InternalFailure，61 InvalidContextInput，62 MissingHashInput，63 HashInputTooLarge。38、41、60 在 lock 主流程中不出现（供 type 脚本 / 辅助 API 使用）。",
      "en": "Error codes from contracts/cobuild-otx-lock/src/error.rs (Error::code): 1–10 ckb-std SysError, 20 InvalidArgs, 30 MalformedCobuild, 31 InvalidOtxLayout, 32 InvalidMessageTarget, 33 DuplicateSighashAll, 34 MissingLockGroupCoverage, 35 MissingLockSeal, 36 DuplicateLockSeal, 38 DuplicateMatchingAction, 39 InvalidLockGroupWitness, 40 LockSemanticFailure, 41 ActionNotFound, 50 VerifyFailure, 60 InternalFailure, 61 InvalidContextInput, 62 MissingHashInput, 63 HashInputTooLarge. 38, 41 and 60 do not occur in the lock flow (they serve type scripts / helper APIs)."
